        "text_WyeYCY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Overview:</strong> Hiatus Craft House is looking for engaging, talented small businesses to sell at our Makers Markets, held monthly at our Distillery. </p><p><strong>Date: </strong>Sunday, March 1, 2026</p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Hiatus Craft House (4045 Via Pescador Suite D, Camarillo, CA 93012)</p><p><strong>Event Time:</strong> 1:00PM to 4:30PM </p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_BiXKCh": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Event Policies",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_VpDGCW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All approved vendors must return a signed contract and pay a <strong>$50 reservation fee</strong> within 96 hours of approval. Each reservation fee will be refunded upon the completion of the market, or may be used to pay for a future market reservation.</p><p></p><p>All vendors <strong>must</strong> provide the following documents:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.ca.gov/departments/287/services/26/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.ca.gov/departments/287/services/26/\"><strong>California Retail Sales Permit</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"https://eco.vcrma.org/area/plancheck/#/home\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://eco.vcrma.org/area/plancheck/#/home\"><strong>Ventura County Health Permit number</strong></a> <em>(Food vendors only)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://cdtfa.ca.gov/formspubs/cdtfa410d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://cdtfa.ca.gov/formspubs/cdtfa410d.pdf\"><strong>CDTFA-410-D Form</strong></a> (Swap Meets, Flea Markets, Or Special Events Certification To Operator)</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Booth Set-Up</strong></span></p><p>Vendors will be provided a booth size of 8' by 6', and must provide their own set-up equipment, including tables. If your booth requires electricity or any additional accommodations, please note in the application below.</p><p>Set-Up Time: 12:00PM (<em>Complete by 12:50PM</em>)</p><p>Break-Down Time:<strong> </strong>4:30PM (<em>Complete by 5:00PM</em>)</p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_H8mCrV": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Selection Process",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_DciLWd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vendor applications will be reviewed, and applicants will be notified within 72 hours of submission. There are limited spaces.</p>"
